    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so permanent though. like there's no version of my life where i'm not this person who's been cast out. even if i tried to talk to a professional, what's the point? they'll just tell me to \"give it time\" or \"people will forgive me,\" but i know them. they've already moved on. i'm just stuck in this hole while everyone else is living like i never even happened. it's just exhausting to keep pretending i'm okay when i'm basically dead to everyone anyway.",
