      "content": "yeah, but feeling it doesn't change the fact that i have nothing to go back to. there's literally nothing for me here. it's like being in a room where the air just ran out. i'm just tired of the weight of it all. does it ever actually get better, or do people just... eventually find a way to make the silence stop?",
